    "solution": "**Passo 1: LKC al nodo 1**\\n$$\\sum i_{uscenti} = 0 \\implies G_1 e_1 + G_2 e_1 + g_m v_1 = 0$$\\nPoiché $v_1 = e_1$:\\n$$(G_1 + G_2 + g_m) e_1 = 0$$\\n\\n**Passo 2: Calcolo del coefficiente $a_{11}$**\\n$$a_{11} = G_1 + G_2 + g_m = \frac{1}{0.5} + \frac{1}{2} + 4 = 2 + 0.5 + 4 = 6.5\\,\\Omega^{-1}$$",
