    "solution": "**1. LKC al nodo 1:**\\n$$(G_1 + G_{12})e_1 + (-G_{12} - g_{m1})e_2 = J_1$$\\n$$a_{11} = G_1 + G_{12} = \frac{1}{0.5} + \frac{1}{2} = 2.0 + 0.5 = 2.50\\,\\Omega^{-1}$$\\n$$a_{12} = -G_{12} - g_{m1} = -0.5 - 2.0 = -2.50\\,\\Omega^{-1}$$\\n\\n**2. LKC al nodo 2:**\\n$$a_{21} = -G_{12} + g_{m2} = -0.5 + 1.0 = 0.50\\,\\Omega^{-1}$$\\n$$a_{22} = G_2 + G_{12} = 1.0 + 0.5 = 1.50\\,\\Omega^{-1}$$\\n\\n**3. Soluzione del sistema per $e_1$:**\\n$$\begin{cases} 2.5 e_1 - 2.5 e_2 = 10 \\ 0.5 e_1 + 1.5 e_2 = -4 \\end{cases} \\implies e_1 = 4.00\text{ V}$$",
